        "quote": "(a) Qualification-based selection is a procurement method for goods and services that does not require an award to the lowest responsible bidder. Qualification-based selection allows the City to evaluate qualifications of a person or a firm and to negotiate project scope, schedule, budget and any other matter relative to procurement. The Director of Contracts and Procurement or designee may initiate a qualifications-based selection in accordance with rules and regulations promulgated pursuant to TMC 3.30.050 .",
